<title>UK: Mid Ocean to bid for remainder of Brockbank.</title>
<headline>Mid Ocean to bid for remainder of Brockbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brockbank Group Plc said on Monday that Mid Ocean Ltd plans to make an offer for the remainder of the company it does not already own.</p>
<p>The Lloyds managing agency group said that in accordance with the shareholders' agreement the two parties will seek an independent determination of the value of Brockbank shares.</p>
<p>Bermuda-based Mid Ocean has a 51 percent controlling interest in Brockbank.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
